WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.660
Spread charge evenly through
a solid plastic ball.

2
00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:06.860
In an insulator, it stays where it is put.

3
00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:09.950
Outside the ball, the field
weakens with distance,

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.910
just like a point charge's.

5
00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.640
Now tunnel in.

6
00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:16.500
Charge surrounds you on every side.

7
00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:21.980
As you head deeper, towards the middle,
does the field get stronger or weaker?

8
00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:25.980
In this mission, you'll choose
Gaussian surfaces that fit a ball,

9
00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:28.480
a long line, or a flat sheet.

10
00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:32.240
Then you'll find the total charge
when it is spread unevenly,

11
00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:34.420
by adding up thin shells.

12
00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:39.240
Your mission: find out what happens to
the field as you go deeper into the ball.
